sk\n\n**commit_sha**: `8c6de26`\n\n**criteria_evidence**:\n- AC-05: test_file `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs`, test_line 366; implementation_file `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs`, implementation_line 93\n\n**concerns**: None. This task genuinely required no new implementation — the plan's characterization as a \"regression-proof\" was verified correct by actually running the test before writing any implementation, matching the established pattern of prior tasks in this plan (03c, 03e) where honest non-red steps are explicitly called out rather than fabricated as red.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>83889</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>17</tool_uses><duration_ms>524933</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
