{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:10:02.746Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a78d5edb76f31aa6c</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01DXweetYae32vrmQS2ybj73</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/5e79b5c6-5688-4728-8d81-ff2c106a0e2e/tasks/a78d5edb76f31aa6c.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-11 (AC-15 regression test)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>## Summary\n\nTASK-11 (AC-15: `[workspace]` with exclude only, no members key) executed and committed.\n\n**Verification steps taken:**\n1. Confirmed all 6 prior commits (TASK-05 through TASK-10) present on `ignore_walk.rs` and tree was clean before starting.\n2. Read AC-15's exact acceptance criterion text from `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json` (line 171-174) — it matched the plan's paraphrase and fixture exactly.\n3. Confirmed via code inspection that `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs:83-113` (`read_cargo_membership`) already handles members-key-absence correctly: `workspace.get(\"members\")` returns `None` naturally, which flows through `.and_then(parse_toml_string_array)` to `None`, meaning `CargoMembership.admits()` falls to `None =&gt; true` — admitting all non-excluded candidates, per AC-15.\n4. Added the integration test `ac15_workspace_table_with_exclude_only_and_no_members_key_admits_non_excluded` to `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs` (line 486). Ran it — it passed immediately (no red step), matching the plan's honest characterization.\n5. **Adversarially verified non-vacuity** (since no red step occurred): temporarily mutated `membership.rs` so members-absent fell back to an empty (excludes-everything) list instead of `None`, reran the test, confirmed it failed (`non-excluded crate must appear, got: []`), then restored the correct code and reconfirmed green.\n6. Ran `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph`, `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean), and the full `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` (282 passed, 0 failed).\n7. Committed as `1e0dc69` — commit hook's format-check passed on first try, no amend needed.\n\nNo implementation code changed — only the test file.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-11\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"verified TASK-05..TASK-10 present and tree clean\",\n    \"read AC-15 exact text from spec file on disk\",\n    \"inspected read_cargo_membership implementation to confirm members-absent already falls back to admit-all via None\",\n    \"wrote integration test ac15_workspace_table_with_exclude_only_and_no_members_key_admits_non_excluded in ignore_walk.rs\",\n    \"ran test, confirmed green immediately (honest non-red step)\",\n    \"adversarially mutated members-absent fallback to excludes-everything, confirmed test then failed, restored correct code\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt, cargo clippy -D warnings (clean), full cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib (282 passed)\",\n    \"committed 1e0dc69\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"1e0dc69\",\n  \"concerns\": null,\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-15\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 486,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 83\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reasoning\": \"Plan and TASK-03e's note both correctly predicted no red step: workspace.get(\\\"members\\\") on an absent key naturally yields None via toml_edit's API, and .and_then(parse_toml_string_array) on None is None without panicking (this was already true since TASK-03d). Unit-level test for this exact fallback (read_cargo_membership_honors_exclude_when_no_members_key_present, membership.rs:201) predates this task via TASK-03e; TASK-05 wired cargo_membership.admits() into IgnoreWalkLocator::projects(). This task's job was purely to add the integration-level regression-proof at the ignore_walk.rs/IgnoreWalkLocator level, which I did, verified green, and adversarially confirmed non-vacuous by breaking then restoring the underlying fallback.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>83977</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>22</tool_uses><duration_ms>403786</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
