{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:42:19.040Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a8c8d3e09e5153e02</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/5e79b5c6-5688-4728-8d81-ff2c106a0e2e/tasks/a8c8d3e09e5153e02.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-16 (AC-08 regression test)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Commit succeeded, pre-commit hook passed. Task complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nTASK-16 executed and committed as `c98ae29`.\n\n**Findings:** As predicted by the plan (matching the TASK-07 through TASK-15 pattern), this was a genuine no-red-step regression-proof — the pnpm-over-npm-workspaces precedence logic was already fully implemented in `read_npm_membership` (membership.rs, wired via TASK-04b/TASK-06). I did not take that on faith: I temporarily neutered the precedence branch in `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs` (replacing `if let Some(packages) = read_pnpm_packages(root)` with a dead branch), reran the new test, confirmed it failed with `tools/x` missing from discovered projects, then restored the original code (verified via `git diff` showing zero net change to membership.rs).\n\nSpec AC-08 text was read directly from `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json` and matches the plan's fixture and assertions essentially verbatim — no gaps found this time (unlike TASK-12/TASK-14).\n\nOne deviation from the plan's draft: the plan's `failing_test.code` used `p.path == PathBuf::from(\"tools/x\")`, which would trip the `clippy::cmp_owned` lint flagged in the task notes. I used `Path::new(\"tools/x\")` instead, consistent with every other test in this file (e.g. `ac04`, `ac06b`).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-16\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"read TASK-16 from plan-track3a-v2.json\",\n    \"read AC-08 acceptance criterion text from SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json\",\n    \"wrote ac08_pnpm_workspace_yaml_takes_precedence_over_package_json_workspaces_field test in ignore_walk.rs\",\n    \"ran test: passed immediately with no implementation change\",\n    \"adversarially disabled pnpm-precedence branch in membership.rs, reran test, confirmed it failed\",\n    \"restored membership.rs to original (verified via git diff showing no changes)\",\n    \"ran full callisto-graph test suite (287 passed)\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt -p callisto-graph\",\n    \"ran cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings (clean)\",\n    \"committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"c98ae29\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-08\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 638,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 257\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": null\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>80213</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>24</tool_uses><duration_ms>385638</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
