L parse failure as \"present but empty\" instead of \"absent\" — confirmed the new test then failed with a clear assertion message — then reverted the mutation exactly (verified `git status` showed membership.rs clean, no diff).\n\nRan full suite (`cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib`): 290 passed, 0 failed. Ran `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` and `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\nCommitted only `crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs` (the file this task is scoped to modify).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-18\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"verified prior 14 commits present and tree clean\",\n    \"read AC-11c criterion text from spec file on disk\",\n    \"wrote test ac11c_malformed_pnpm_yaml_does_not_count_as_present_for_precedence\",\n    \"ran test: passed immediately (honest non-red, matches plan note)\",\n    \"adversarial verification: mutated read_pnpm_packages to treat malformed YAML as present-but-empty, confirmed test failed\",\n    \"reverted mutation, confirmed membership.rs clean\",\n    \"ran full callisto-graph test suite: 290 passed\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt and cargo clippy -D warnings: clean\",\n    \"committed ignore_walk.rs\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"1590c3b\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-11c\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 875,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 273\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": null,\n  \"reasoning\": \"Regression-proof task as predicted by the plan; no implementation change needed since TASK-04c/TASK-06 already hardened read_pnpm_packages's YAML-parse-error fallback with .ok()?. Adversarial mutation confirmed the test genuinely exercises that fallback path rather than being v